<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">CAPTURE / REVIEW / CONFIRM</view>
  <view class="title">{{titles[kind]}}</view>
  <view class="notice">
    识别是辅助，不是事实。每个字段都能改，确认后才会写入记录；原图不持久保存。
  </view>
  <button bindtap="photo" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">
    拍照 / 从相册选择
  </button>
  <view class="card">
    <textarea
      value="{{text}}"
      data-key="text"
      bindinput="field"
      placeholder="自然语言录入或修正，如：把番茄改成400g"
    />
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="text" disabled="{{busy}}">
      {{draft?'让 AI 修改这份草稿':'从文字生成草稿'}}
    </button>
  </view>
  <block wx:if="{{draft}}">
    <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="index" class="card">
      <view class="row">
        <view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view>
        <text class="badge {{item.estimated?'warn':''}}">
          {{item.estimated?'估算':'待确认精确值'}}
        </text>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{!item.matched}}" class="notice">
        未匹配，请手动选择食材。
      </text>
      <picker
        range="{{catalog}}"
        range-key="name"
        value="{{item.foodIndex}}"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bindchange="matched"
      >
        {{item.matched?catalog[item.foodIndex].name:'点此手动匹配'}} ▾
      </picker>
      <view class="label">
        重量（克）{{item.estimate_range_pct?' · 估算范围
        ±'+item.estimate_range_pct+'%':''}}
      </view>
      <input
        type="digit"
        value="{{item.grams}}"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        data-key="grams"
        bindinput="row"
      />
      <view class="row label">
        <text>估算数据</text>
        <switch
          checked="{{item.estimated}}"
          data-index="{{index}}"
          data-key="estimated"
          bindchange="row"
        />
      </view>
      <block wx:if="{{kind!=='meal'}}">
        <view class="label">确认食用期限</view>
        <picker
          mode="date"
          value="{{item.expires}}"
          data-index="{{index}}"
          data-key="expires"
          bindchange="row"
        >
          {{item.expires}}
        </picker>
      </block>
      <block wx:if="{{kind==='receipt'}}">
        <view class="label">该行金额（元，可留空）</view>
        <input
          type="digit"
          value="{{item.price}}"
          data-index="{{index}}"
          data-key="price"
          bindinput="row"
        />
      </block>
      <button class="mini danger" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">
        移除此条
      </button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{kind==='receipt'}}" class="card">
      <view class="heading">实际支付总金额（元）</view>
      <input type="digit" value="{{paid}}" data-key="paid" bindinput="field" />
      <view class="row label">
        <text>我已核对实付金额</text>
        <switch checked="{{actual}}" data-key="actual" bindchange="field" />
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{kind==='meal'}}" class="card">
      <picker
        range="{{contexts}}"
        value="{{contextIndex}}"
        data-key="contextIndex"
        bindchange="field"
      >
        {{contexts[contextIndex]}}
      </picker>
      <view class="notice">
        上方分量应为你本人摄入的原料可食重量。共同烹饪的其他分量，请在库存页另行记录。
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{contextIndex==0}}" class="row label">
        <text>按上述分量同步扣减库存</text>
        <switch checked="{{deduct}}" data-key="deduct" bindchange="field" />
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:for="{{draft.warnings}}" wx:key="index" class="notice">
      {{item}}
    </view>
    <button bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">
      我已逐项核对 · 确认保存
    </button>
  </block>
</view>
